Error [jet.MissingRunFunction]: This program has no `run` function
 Why: A program starts at its top-level statements or its `run: fn`, and the entry file has neither
 Fix: Write the statements to run at the top level of the entry file, or add `run: fn() { ... }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0101

1 problem found
